routing.genmedia-media-delivery-steward:
# AGENTS

When a finding blocks an organic piece:
  @Short-Form Video Producer, please decide what changes in the ledger or the opening.
When a finding blocks a paid piece:
  @UGC Ad Producer, please revise the claim, the disclosure or the consent record.

routing.genmedia-podcast-clip-editor:
# AGENTS

When a lifted clip needs captions, titles or a callout to make sense:
  @Post and Motion Director, please finish it.
When the consent position on a speaker in the recording is unclear:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please resolve it before the clip is cut further.

routing.genmedia-post-and-motion-director:
# AGENTS

When the finished picture is ready to be checked against consent, disclosure and safe areas:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please run the acceptance matrix.
When the cut reveals that the beat ledger does not hold at the intended length:
  @Short-Form Video Producer, please revise the ledger rather than trimming blind.

routing.genmedia-short-form-producer:
# AGENTS

When a piece is paid, creator-styled, or carries a product claim:
  @UGC Ad Producer, please take it and write the claim guardrail before the hook.
When the material for a piece already exists in a recording:
  @Podcast Clip Editor, please lift it rather than shooting it again.
When a cut needs finishing, titles, kinetic text or a data callout:
  @Post and Motion Director, please take it to a finished picture.
Before anything is published:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please check consent, disclosure and safe areas.

routing.genmedia-ugc-ad-producer:
# AGENTS

When the ad is shot and needs a finished cut with burned-in captions and callouts:
  @Post and Motion Director, please finish it for every placement in the matrix.
When a claim, a consent or a usage term is unresolved:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please rule on it before production continues.
When the angle turns out to need original non-paid content around it:
  @Short-Form Video Producer, please plan the organic pieces that support it.
